# The repository checks read source with regular expressions written for LF. A Windows checkout
# with core.autocrlf=true (GitHub Desktop's default) rewrote every file as CRLF, and four checks
# failed on a tree that was correct. Every file is already stored as LF; this keeps it LF on disk too.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
